  - id: templar
    displayName: Templar
    rank: D
    parent: 
    description: 'Carries the light into the fight. Smite deals 30% more damage. Magic skills deal 10% more damage. New skill: Hammer of Light (level 16).'
    passives:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8fd46b599dfb5d445a9aa1932a8dac95, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41bc90a8788f9434d967d8711e0841ee, type: 2}
  - id: oracle
    displayName: Oracle
    rank: B
    parent: priest
    description: 'Sees who will fall, and gets there first. Sanctuary has a 30% shorter cooldown. Mending Light fires 2 more bolts in a fan. New skills: Circle of Light (level 56), Blessed Bolt (level 62).'
    passives:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 41cc5017c8748b74294bcbbbe6250cf9, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8da9d9f90c087414396c7cc8cd62d7cd, type: 2}
  - id: saint
    displayName: Saint
    rank: B
    parent: priest
    description: 'Turns a lost fight around. Mending Light has a 25% shorter cooldown. Sanctuary restores 30% more health. New skills: Miracle (level 56), Halo (level 62).'
    passives:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 254c70b7fec6b5944bb31041e6a9ddc2, type: 2}
