  - id: paladin
    displayName: Paladin
    rank: B
    parent: templar
    description: 'A holy knight in the front line. Judgement deals 35% more damage. Holy Nova covers 1 m more around it. New skills: Divine Hammer (level 56), Consecrate (level 62).'
    passives:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6a6819729b2d7b043996bb7040545ffa, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4dec2c13d633c543abd00fcdcf6cd38, type: 2}
  - id: inquisitor
    displayName: Inquisitor
    rank: B
    parent: templar
    description: 'Burns the wicked from far away. Radiant Lance deals 30% more damage and has a 20% shorter cooldown. Magic skills deal 15% more damage. New skills: Searing Light (level 56), Final Verdict (level 62).'
